Package: nvcx
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nvc (>= 1.23.0-1+nvcx1),
 verilator (>= 5.054+git202611072109.74cf7aa-1+nvcx2), tcllib
Description: AMD/Xilinx xsim cores inside the NVC VHDL simulator
 nvcx embeds AMD/Xilinx's xsim simulator inside NVC, so that encrypted IP,
 XPM macros and SystemVerilog with generics can be simulated within an
 otherwise open-source NVC simulation.
 .
 The package provides a VHPI plugin for NVC (nvc --load), the bridge
 entity, a Tcl package for generating each core's shell (nvc --do), and a
 pkg-config file locating them.
 .
 Vivado 2023.2 or later is needed at run time, located by XILINX_VIVADO;
 it is not packaged.
